vs cost = zero."},{"id":"rls_policy_pattern","label":"Row Level Security (RLS) Policy Pattern","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Fix & Hardening Runbook.md","source_location":"Fix 1","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"RLS enforces data isolation at database level as second validation layer after Edge Functions. MFA check in RLS uses user_metadata->>'mfa_verified' as Free Tier workaround; audit identifies this should migrate to aal2 claim."},{"id":"webhook_idempotency_pattern","label":"Webhook Idempotency Pattern","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Fix & Hardening Runbook.md","source_location":"Fix 2","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Webhook events must check event_id in webhook_logs before processing to prevent double stock deduction or duplicate emails when payment processors retry delivery."},{"id":"pgsodium_encryption","label":"pgsodium Credential Encryption","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Fix & Hardening Runbook.md","source_location":"Fix 3","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Payment gateway credentials encrypted via pgsodium.crypto_secretbox to avoid plaintext storage. Critical fix: original code had EXCEPTION fallback that silently stored credentials unencrypted."},{"id":"jamstack_ssg_pattern","label":"Jamstack SSG Architecture Pattern","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Especificación de Requisitos de Software (SRS).md","source_location":"2.4","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Storefront uses Astro SSG for maximum SEO performance. Catalog rebuilt via trigger-rebuild Edge Function when product data changes, enabling zero-cost static hosting on Cloudflare Pages."},{"id":"docker_first_principle","label":"Docker-First Development Principle","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Sprint 0.md","source_location":"Principio","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"All development tooling runs inside Docker containers to eliminate local dependency management. Only Git and Docker required on host machine."},{"id":"audit_critical_totp_broken","label":"CRÍTICO-1: TOTP Hardcoded Secret","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/audit/AUDITORÍA TÉCNICA PROFUNDA.md","source_location":"CRÍTICO-1","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"setup-totp uses same secret for all users and confirm-totp accepts hardcoded code '123456'. MFA is theater — any attacker enters '123456' to gain vendor access. Must use otplib with per-user encrypted secrets."},{"id":"audit_critical_webhook_no_sig","label":"CRÍTICO-3: Webhooks Sin Verificación de Firma","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/audit/AUDITORÍA TÉCNICA PROFUNDA.md","source_location":"CRÍTICO-3","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"payment-webhook receives _signature parameter but never uses it. Anyone with the URL can POST fake events marking orders as paid. Stripe.webhooks.constructEvent must be used for signature validation."},{"id":"audit_critical_plaintext_creds","label":"CRÍTICO-4: Plaintext Credential Fallback","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/audit/AUDITORÍA TÉCNICA PROFUNDA.md","source_location":"CRÍTICO-4","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"00004_payment_functions.sql has EXCEPTION WHEN OTHERS block that silently stores credentials as plaintext BYTEA if pgsodium fails. Must be removed — fail explicitly."},{"id":"islands_architecture_pattern","label":"Astro Islands Architecture Pattern","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Especificación de Requisitos de Software (SRS).md","source_location":"2.4","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Astro handles static markup and SSR; React used only for interactive UI components with client:* directives. Alpine.js acceptable for minimal interactivity. This minimizes JS bundle shipped to browser."},{"id":"zero_cost_ops_principle","label":"Zero Operational Cost Principle","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Especificación de Requisitos de Software (SRS).md","source_location":"2.1, RNF-19","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"System designed to operate exclusively on free tiers (Cloudflare Pages, Supabase). All architectural decisions constrained by this — including MFA implementation via user_metadata instead of paid aal2."},{"id":"edge_functions_stateless","label":"Stateless Edge Functions Pattern","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Especificación de Requisitos de Software (SRS).md","source_location":"RNF-21","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Edge Functions must be stateless to enable horizontal scaling on Supabase Deno runtime. All state lives in PostgreSQL."},{"id":"rate_limiting_sql","label":"SQL Pure Rate Limiting via check_rate_limit","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/Documentación Técnica.md","source_location":"Section 9","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Rate limiting implemented via SQL function check_rate_limit(identifier, endpoint, limit, window) using auth.uid() or IP as identifier. Chosen for zero additional cost vs Redis or Deno.KV."}],"edges":[{"source":"auth_client_signInWithEmail","target":"auth_client_supabaseClient","relation":"calls","confidence":"EXTRACTED","confidence_score":1.0,"source_file":"apps/client-hub/src/lib/auth/auth-client.ts","source_location":"line 15","weight":1.0},{"source":"auth_client_signInWithGoogle","target":"auth_client_supabaseClient","relation":"calls","confidence":"EXTRACTED","confidence_score":1.0,"source_file":"apps/client-hub/src/lib/auth/auth-client.ts","source_location":"line 29","weight":1.0},{"source":"auth_